  "content": "<p>One of our members recently joined a stained glass workshop to learn the basics, and quickly turned that knowledge into her own creations.</p><p>She designed and built two beautiful pieces after the course, each with its own distinct style.</p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/stainedglass\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>stainedglass</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/glassart\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>glassart</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/handmade\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>handmade</span></a></p>",
